  "worked_solution": "For any two finite sets $Z$ and $Y,$ the cardinality of $Z\\times Y$ is\n\n$$\n|Z\\times Y|=|Z|\\cdot |Y|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|Z\\times Y| & =|Z|\\cdot |Y| \\\\  & =6\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
